+- Hardened Mini LaunchAgent installers so they boot out by label and plist path before bootstrapping; this fixed a `launchctl bootstrap` I/O error caused by already-loaded agents.
+
+### Live Verification
+- `bash -n` passed for:
+  - `scripts/mini/mini-prepare-automation-root.sh`
