+- Mini LaunchAgent `com.saneapps.training-challengers` now has the five-model rotation.
+- Mini automation root contains the new SaneAI challenger configs.
+- Qwen3 0.6B smoke completed:
+  - report: `~/SaneApps/outputs/automation-smoke/qwen3-0.6b/challenger_report_SaneAI_qwen3-0.6b.md`
+  - `2` training steps
+  - `1.197 it/sec`
+  - `19.758 tokens/sec`
+  - `2.499 GB` peak memory
+  - `0%` strict workflow score
+
+### Current State
+- Production remains SmolLM3.
+- SmolLM3 is operationally better than Llama on this Mini: recent Llama runs failed fast with exit `134`; SmolLM3 trains, but strict workflow JSON quality is still weak.
+- The small-model bakeoff is live in scheduled testing.
+
+### Next
+- Let nightly runs collect full 50-iter results before changing production.
+- Compare challengers on strict workflow score, raw score, runtime, tokens/sec, and peak memory.
+- Treat Qwen3.5 OptiQ as experimental until one scheduled full run proves direct `mlx-lm` LoRA compatibility.
